>## Decode an Either value using the provided left and right decoders
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term decodeEither = λleftDecoder,rightDecoder,g,`term`.eithers.bind (stripWithDecodingError g `term`) (λstripped.cases(model.Term){`either`=λe.eithers.either (λlv.eithers.map (λx.left(x)) (leftDecoder g lv)) (λrv.eithers.map (λx.right(x)) (rightDecoder g rv)) e, `_`=left(errors.DecodingError{"expected either value"})} stripped)
