>## Decode a list of elements using the provided element decoder
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term decodeList = λelemDecoder,g,`term`.eithers.bind (stripWithDecodingError g `term`) (λstripped.cases(model.Term){`list`=λels.eithers.mapList (elemDecoder g) els, `_`=left(errors.DecodingError{"expected list"})} stripped)
