>
>## Extract an either value from a term, applying functions to the left and right values
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term eitherTerm = λleftFun,rightFun,graph,term0.eithers.bind (lexical.stripAndDereferenceTerm graph term0) (λ`term`.cases(model.Term){`either`=λet.eithers.either (λl.eithers.map (λx.left(x)) (leftFun l)) (λr.eithers.map (λx.right(x)) (rightFun r)) et, `_`=left(errors.Error{extraction = errors.ExtractionError{unexpectedShape = errors.UnexpectedShapeError{expected = "either value", actual = print.model.term `term`}}})} `term`)
