>## Extract a float32 value from a FloatValue
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term float32Value = λv.cases(model.FloatValue){`float32`=λf.right(f), `_`=left(errors.Error{extraction = errors.ExtractionError{unexpectedShape = errors.UnexpectedShapeError{expected = "float32", actual = print.model.float v}}})} v
