>
>## Extract a pair of values from a term, applying functions to each component
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term pair = λkf,vf,graph,term0.eithers.bind (lexical.stripAndDereferenceTerm graph term0) (λ`term`.cases(model.Term){pair=λp.eithers.bind (kf (pairs.first p)) (λkVal.eithers.bind (vf (pairs.second p)) (λvVal.right((kVal, vVal)))), `_`=left(errors.Error{extraction = errors.ExtractionError{unexpectedShape = errors.UnexpectedShapeError{expected = "pair", actual = print.model.term `term`}}})} `term`)
