>
>## Extract a unit variant (a variant with an empty record value) from a union term
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term unitVariant = λtname,graph,`term`.eithers.bind (injection tname graph `term`) (λfield.eithers.bind (`unit` (model.Field[`term`] field)) (λignored.right(model.Field[name] field)))
