>## Extract the wrapped type from a wrapper type
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term wrappedType = λename,typ.let stripped := strip.deannotateType typ in cases(model.Type){`wrap`=λinnerType.right(innerType), `_`=left(errors.Error{extraction = errors.ExtractionError{unexpectedShape = errors.UnexpectedShapeError{expected = "wrapped type", actual = print.model.type typ}}})} stripped
